      "required": true,
      "expected": "Both predefined cross-role questions have substantive source-backed answers delivered through the assigned arm, and the coordinator retains all facts marked dependency_finding or explicitly records an unresolved dependency.",
      "checks": [
        "Compare original worker finding IDs/claims with final handoff.",
        "Check assigned routing from actually available evidence plus paired sender/receiver receipts; label receipts agent-reported.",
        "If actual delivery cannot be established, delivery is NOT_RUN/NOT_EXPOSED; do not fabricate proof. If it is observed that no required exchange occurred, FAIL.",
